### Item stored in dynamodb 
```
{
            "PK": {
                "S": "SHOP#Apple"
            },
            "SK": {
                "S": "PROFILE#Apple"
            },
            "shopName": {
                "S": "Apple"
            }
        }
```


## Actual behavior
### Item stored in dynamodb 
```
{
            "PK": {
                "S": "SHOP#${ctx.args.shop.shopName}"
            },
            "SK": {
